OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStarlink restrictions affecting
OL,4,AUkraine's front line operations, Kyiv
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew restrictions on the speed at which
OL,8,Fsome of Ukraine's weapons can travel
OL,9,Fand still connect to the Starlink
OL,10,Finternet network have disrupted
OL,11,FUkraine's battlefield "missions",
OL,12,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky's adviser
OL,13,Fhas warned.
OL,15,FSerhiy Beskrestnov said Ukraine had not
OL,16,Fbeen told about speed limits set
OL,17,Fovernight at 100mph (160km/h) by Elon
OL,18,FMusk's SpaceX company.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
