OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStarlink restrictions affecting
OL,4,AUkraine's front line operations, Kyiv
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FStarlink is a vital tool allowing Kyiv
OL,8,Fto effectively guide drones to Russian
OL,9,Ftargets and also protect Ukrainian
OL,10,Fskies.
OL,12,FBeskrestnov said SpaceX's move "cannot
OL,13,Fbe a coincidence and is related to the
OL,14,Fcurrent political situation". The firm
OL,15,Fhas not commented.
